  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The decision to add EAC to VRC is absolutely one of the most horrendous decisions you could have made. EAC isn't the end all be all, in every game that still uses EAC there are still modders/hackers that ruin the game for everyone. But taking away essential mods from people isn't the way to go about tackling the problem of malicious clients/mods. But if you truly believe EAC is the way to go, add the option for it. Games like Halo Infinite have this option and it'd be amazing for this to be the case for VRChat.",
